ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/e9c5d53122a9607d71bcfca09283ba86.poster.avif?t=1759680954\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/e9c5d53122a9607d71bcfca09283ba86.webm?t=1759680954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crossroads with Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you may encounter new faces. Each survivor brings a different story and a unique playstyle. Finding them not only offers fresh perspectives but also unlocks them as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/70d564eb5966378250439637e86a6f6f.poster.avif?t=1759680954\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/70d564eb5966378250439637e86a6f6f.webm?t=1759680954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Limited Inventory, Endless Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your backpack capacity forces tough decisions. The wrong choice could cost your life. Combine items to craft stronger gear and gain extra advantages with special backpacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/2a8bbc30bb569713e12673d94dcd8103.poster.avif?t=1759680954\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/2a8bbc30bb569713e12673d94dcd8103.webm?t=1759680954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></vi